WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.115 --> 00:00:01.484
- My heart is racing.

00:00:01.484 --> 00:00:03.945
- They're really, really,
gross, really revolting.

00:00:03.945 --> 00:00:05.664
- They'll kill you with one bite.

00:00:05.664 --> 00:00:07.969
- I hate spiders, like with a passion.

00:00:08.306 --> 00:00:10.653
(rock music)

00:00:11.831 --> 00:00:14.943
- Hi, I'm Diana Terranova and
I'm a live insect handler.

00:00:14.943 --> 00:00:16.963
Today we're going to be helping people

00:00:16.963 --> 00:00:19.422
get over their fear of spiders.

00:00:20.469 --> 00:00:22.071
- This is real, my hand
is shaking for real.

00:00:22.071 --> 00:00:24.160
- When we're handling the
spiders what we want to do

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:25.879
is we want to be as quiet as possible.

00:00:25.879 --> 00:00:27.954
- Oh god that's not small at all!

00:00:28.293 --> 00:00:30.166
- Now actually this is a juvenile so...

00:00:30.166 --> 00:00:31.345
Did you just cross yourself?

00:00:31.345 --> 00:00:32.000
- (laughs) yeah.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.694
- [Woman] Look at its legs
they move all at the same time!

00:00:34.694 --> 00:00:35.825
Why?

00:00:35.825 --> 00:00:37.564
- Oh, they are soft.

00:00:37.564 --> 00:00:38.725
- [Diana] It's soft right?

00:00:38.725 --> 00:00:41.339
(screaming)

00:00:41.339 --> 00:00:42.538
- Do they smell fear?

00:00:42.538 --> 00:00:44.024
Does he know that I am afraid?

00:00:44.024 --> 00:00:46.740
- You're doing great, hey you did this.

00:00:46.740 --> 00:00:50.107
This one right here is a
chilean red flame dwarf.

00:00:50.107 --> 00:00:53.033
They're a tiny spider but
they're actually full grown.

00:00:54.340 --> 00:00:55.378
- Oh my god!

00:00:55.378 --> 00:00:57.839
- Oh no! (laughing)

00:00:57.839 --> 00:00:59.348
- Why would you torture is like that?

00:00:59.348 --> 00:01:01.786
- They actually love to
be in small dark places.

00:01:01.786 --> 00:01:02.669
- Okay.

00:01:02.669 --> 00:01:04.364
- Why? Get him...

00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:05.641
Oh, I don't like it!

00:01:05.641 --> 00:01:07.452
- Will this kill me if it bites me?

00:01:07.452 --> 00:01:09.727
- Maybe it will take you to the E.R.

00:01:09.727 --> 00:01:13.140
Now you might want to get
yourself a multipoo doggy,

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:16.461
a little hybrid, but
nature has created its own

00:01:16.461 --> 00:01:19.619
hybrid arachnid in the whip scorpion.

00:01:19.619 --> 00:01:21.801
- (gasps) Oh!

00:01:21.801 --> 00:01:24.216
- It's like a cricket and a cockroach

00:01:24.216 --> 00:01:26.329
and a scorpion with that tail.

00:01:26.329 --> 00:01:27.467
It almost looks like a shrimp.

00:01:27.467 --> 00:01:29.928
- This is what Will Smith
killed in Men In Black!

00:01:29.928 --> 00:01:31.901
- I'm starting to get a
little bit more relaxed.

00:01:31.901 --> 00:01:33.736
- It's like a bunch of twigs on my hand.

00:01:33.736 --> 00:01:35.361
- I just was worried you
didn't get it close enough.

00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:36.429
- Yeah, no I did.

00:01:36.429 --> 00:01:38.263
- It's still weird
looking and it feels weird

00:01:38.263 --> 00:01:40.283
and if I saw this I'd still
kind of want to kill it.

00:01:40.283 --> 00:01:41.468
I'm so sorry.

00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:43.859
- Oh my gosh, everybody
should have one of these

00:01:43.859 --> 00:01:45.717
they're the perfect present for Christmas,

00:01:45.717 --> 00:01:47.992
for Valentines Day, you name it.

00:01:47.992 --> 00:01:50.244
It's a rose hair tarantula.

00:01:50.244 --> 00:01:51.730
- That is not a spider, that is a rodent.

00:01:51.730 --> 00:01:53.170
- She needs you she needs you.

00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:53.843
- Does she?

00:01:53.843 --> 00:01:55.562
- Don't you think it's like
a new jewelry statement?

00:01:55.562 --> 00:01:56.885
- No.

00:01:56.885 --> 00:01:57.883
- Now put your other hand again.

00:01:57.883 --> 00:01:59.346
- (squeals)

00:01:59.346 --> 00:02:01.204
I'm just holding a spider by myself.

00:02:01.204 --> 00:02:02.411
- She trying to get in my mouth?

00:02:02.411 --> 00:02:03.781
Do they all hang out in your mouth?

00:02:03.781 --> 00:02:05.685
- Say bye!

00:02:05.685 --> 00:02:07.566
Kiss her leg.

00:02:08.665 --> 00:02:10.654
- I've held a snake,
I've jumped off cliffs,

00:02:10.654 --> 00:02:12.999
and this is still one
of the scariest things

00:02:12.999 --> 00:02:14.346
I've done in my entire life.

00:02:14.346 --> 00:02:18.386
- As like a species, I like
you, I appreciate you guys,

00:02:18.386 --> 00:02:20.290
I like you from a distance.

00:02:20.290 --> 00:02:22.287
Like I like my ex
boyfriends from a distance.

00:02:22.287 --> 00:02:25.026
- I'm definitely less
scared of big spiders.

00:02:25.026 --> 00:02:27.952
I still don't really like
small spiders I guess.

00:02:27.952 --> 00:02:29.150
- Am I still going to run away from them?

00:02:29.150 --> 00:02:30.198
Yes.

00:02:30.828 --> 00:02:34.541
But will I be able to not scream as loud?

00:02:34.541 --> 00:02:35.953
Maybe.

00:02:36.474 --> 00:02:39.120
(rock music)

